  "description": "I trapped 4 strangers in an entire supermarket and the only way out is eating everything inside\n\nThe guys wore Fitbit Air to track their health and fitness throughout their entire time in the store. See what they achieved during the Google Health Awards. GooglePartner\nGoogle Store: https://www.jdoqocy.com/click-100988033-15751464?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstore.google.com%2Fconfig%2Fgoogle_fitbit_air%3Fsku%3D_google_fitbit_air_obsidian&sid=YT3-C4EGzVjxI_xF6NgSwwEfKMiFfNRQ7aLkO2IyMJdsmb7S3hBTWCeUc-mgHQ_ofID6TDXlZnk46TQbwNOZnToAdEWXTHN3F8MWOiYxSCo\nAmazon: https://www.amazon.com/Fitbit-Google-Air-Screenless-Activity/dp/B0GTMTZF3V?maas=maas_adg_6671CEA13701B4B69160FE4996FE8D25_afap_abs&ref_=aa_maas&tag=maas\nAmazon CA: https://www.amazon.ca/dp/B0GHSNQKXX?maas=maas_adg_E13A27015EB1D05E2A7B77D9169B232F_afap_abs&ref_=aa_maas&tag=maas\nAmazon UK: https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B0GHSPCBV9?maas=maas_adg_87E620143421E47F1E80B03D2AA22FB4_afap_abs&ref_=aa_maas&tag=maas\n\nCan the guys win the ultimate endurance challenge in Kizik hands-free shoes? See how they put these shoes to the test. Go to https://www.kizik.com/mrbeast for 15% off some of their top styles. KizikPartner\n\nSpecial thanks to iFIT for providing equipment, and iFIT trainer John Peel for helping prepare our contestants for the ultimate endurance and eating challenge! https://www.instagram.com/johnpeelfitness iFITPartner \n\nGood Ranchers stocked our grocery store with 100% American meat. You can get the same high-quality meat without doing the challenge. Get $100 off + a free gift with every order when you visit https://www.goodranchers.com/beast and start a plan. GoodRanchersPartner\n\nHuge thanks to the brands that helped stock our grocery store: all Free Clear, Purex, Persil, Snuggle, Campbell’s V8 Energy and SpaghettiOs, Mama Mancini’s Meatballs, Danone Silk, Knorr, TheWonerfulCompany, Matt’s Organic, Junkless, Crisp Power Pretzels, Hippeas, Mi Niña, Danone/Oikos, NOW Foods, Fairlife, OLIPOP, POM 